{"type":"message","id":"fd091213","parentId":"c1914f66","timestamp":"2026-02-02T15:08:25.051Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Run Sasha's daily job scan. Read /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/sasha-job-search/search-config.json for search parameters and /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/sasha-job-search/resume.md for her CV.\n\nSearch for matching clinical ops, regulatory affairs, research manager roles. Location: Baltimore 30mi + remote. Salary floor: 85K+.\n\nLINK RULES (CRITICAL):\n1. Search for jobs using web_search, then find the REAL LinkedIn posting URL for each job.\n2. For EVERY LinkedIn link, you MUST verify it works by fetching it with web_fetch BEFORE including it.\n3. If a link redirects to a generic search page, shows 'expired_jd_redirect', or returns a page title like \"X jobs in United States\" — that link is DEAD. Do NOT include it.\n4. A working LinkedIn link will have the actual job title in the page title or content.\n5. It is better to list 3 jobs with VERIFIED working links than 10 with broken ones. Zero tolerance for dead links.\n6. Do NOT fabricate or guess LinkedIn job IDs. Only use URLs you found from actual search results.\n7. If you cannot find a working LinkedIn link for a job, use the direct employer career page link instead — but still verify it.\n\nGenerate report following the template in /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/sasha-job-search/templates/daily-report.md. Save report to /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/sasha-job-search/reports/ directory. Send the full formatted report as output."}],"timestamp":1770044905047}}
{"type":"message","id":"56a0172a","parentId":"fd091213","timestamp":"2026-02-02T15:08:30.889Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to run Sasha's daily job scan. Let me break down what I need to do:\n\n1. Read the search-config.json file for search parameters\n2. Read the resume.md file for her CV\n3. Read the daily-report.md template\n4. Search for jobs matching clinical ops, regulatory affairs, research manager roles\n5. Location: Baltimore 30mi + remote\n6. Salary floor: 85K+\n7. Verify all LinkedIn links before including them\n8. Generate a report following the template\n9. Save to the reports directory\n\nLet me start by reading the necessary files.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"I'll run Sasha's daily job scan. Let me start by reading the configuration files and resume."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read:0","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/sasha-job-search/search-config.json"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read:1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/sasha-job-search/resume.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read:2","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/sasha-job-search/templates/daily-report.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"moonshot","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":6805,"output":232,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":7037,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770044905049}}
{"type":"message","id":"046c8e10","parentId":"56a0172a","timestamp":"2026-02-02T15:08:30.916Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:0","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"candidate\": {\n    \"name\": \"Sasha Greenspan, PhD\",\n    \"email\": \"sasha.greenspan@gmail.com\",\n    \"location\": \"Baltimore, MD\",\n    \"resumeFile\": \"Sasha_Greenspan_Resume_010326\",\n    \"resumeDate\": \"2026-01-03\",\n    \"summary\": \"Research operations leader with 20+ years building and scaling complex clinical and biological research programs. PhD Biology, deep experience in device-enabled clinical studies, GCP/ICH compliance, REDCap, IRB submissions, team leadership. Currently Program Admin at Kennedy Krieger Institute / Johns Hopkins University.\"\n  },\n  \"search\": {\n    \"keywords\": [\n      \"Clinical Operations Support\",\n      \"Clinical Project Assistant\",\n      \"Clinical Project Specialist\",\n      \"Learning and Development\",\n      \"Regulatory Specialist\",\n      \"Regulatory Affairs\",\n      \"Research Manager\",\n      \"Hospital Administration\"\n    ],\n    \"jobTitles\": [\n      \"Clinical Trial Manager\",\n      \"Regulatory Specialist\",\n      \"Research Manager\",\n      \"Clinical Operations Lead\",\n      \"Hospital Administrator\",\n      \"Administrator\"\n    ],\n    \"location\": {\n      \"base\": \"Baltimore, MD\",\n      \"radiusMiles\": 30,\n      \"remote\": true,\n      \"hybrid\": true\n    },\n    \"salary\": {\n      \"floor\": 85000,\n      \"ceiling\": null,\n      \"note\": \"No ceiling — sky's the limit 🚀\"\n    },\n    \"dealbreakers\": [\n      \"Travel required\",\n      \"Requires 5+ years CRO experience (she doesn't have this)\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"companies\": {\n    \"specific\": [\n      \"Headlands Research\",\n      \"Pharmaron\",\n      \"Axon\",\n      \"AstraZeneca\",\n      \"Johns Hopkins University\",\n      \"University of Maryland\",\n      \"University of Maryland Baltimore\",\n      \"Takeda\",\n      \"BeOne\",\n      \"Katalyst CRO\",\n      \"RTI International\",\n      \"FHI Clinical\",\n      \"Population Council\",\n      \"Emergent BioSolutions\",\n      \"Rho Inc\",\n      \"BioLink 360\",\n      \"CareFirst\",\n      \"McLaughlin Research Institute\",\n      \"EmVenio\",\n      \"Intralytix\",\n      \"Ascension\",\n      \"Kymera Therapeutics\",\n      \"Boeson Research\",\n      \"Alliance Clinical Network\",\n      \"Velocity Clinical Research\",\n      \"Vertex\",\n      \"Medtronic\",\n      \"Gilead Sciences\",\n      \"Philips\",\n      \"Regeneron\",\n      \"Amgen\",\n      \"Precision for Medicine\",\n      \"Geneva Foundation\",\n      \"Nordberg Medical\",\n      \"Paradigm Health\"\n    ],\n    \"general\": [\n      \"Pharma\",\n      \"Biotech\",\n      \"Hospital\",\n      \"Health Tech\",\n      \"Research Institutes\",\n      \"Universities\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"report\": {\n    \"deliverTo\": \"Doug via Telegram\",\n    \"tone\": \"casual/friendly\",\n    \"groupBy\": \"company\",\n    \"scope\": \"comprehensive\",\n    \"frequency\": \"daily\",\n    \"time\": \"6:00 AM ET\",\n    \"includeIfEmpty\": true\n  },\n  \"tracking\": {\n    \"previouslyFound\": [\n      \"JHU - Sr. Clinical Research Program Manager\",\n      \"JHU - Research Program Coordinator\",\n      \"Takeda - Senior Manager, Clinical Data Management (REMOTE)\",\n      \"Takeda - Manager, Clinical Outcome Assessment Operations (REMOTE)\",\n      \"Precision Medicine Group - Project Manager (FULLY REMOTE)\",\n      \"Precision for Medicine - Clinical Project Manager\",\n      \"UMB - Senior Director, Clinical Research Operations & Compliance\",\n      \"UMB - Director, Clinical Research Operations & Compliance\",\n      \"FHI 360 - Project Specialist I (FHI Clinical)\",\n      \"Worldwide Clinical Trials - Clinical Project Manager (REMOTE)\"\n    ],\n    \"removedJobs\": [\n      \"CareFirst - Program Manager, Clinical Support Operations (link expired)\"\n    ],\n    \"companiesSearched\": [\n      \"Johns Hopkins University\",\n      \"University of Maryland Baltimore\",\n      \"Takeda\",\n      \"Precision for Medicine\",\n      \"Precision Medicine Group\",\n      \"CareFirst BlueCross BlueShield\",\n      \"FHI 360\",\n      \"Worldwide Clinical Trials\",\n      \"Pharmaron\",\n      \"Emergent BioSolutions\",\n      \"RTI International\",\n      \"Medtronic\",\n      \"AstraZeneca\"\n    ],\n    \"lastScanDate\": \"2026-02-02\"\n  }\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770044910915}}
{"type":"message","id":"0038403b","parentId":"046c8e10","timestamp":"2026-02-02T15:08:30.919Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Sasha Greenspan, PhD\n\n352-575-8605 | sasha.greenspan@gmail.com | LinkedIn | Google Scholar | Baltimore, MD\n\n## SUMMARY\nResearch operations leader with 20+ years building and scaling complex clinical and biological research programs. Deep experience leading end-to-end, device-enabled clinical studies (start-up through close-out), coordinating sites and vendors, and overseeing GCP/ICH-compliant workflows. Known for translating regulatory and technical complexity into efficient, patient-centered execution that drives enrollment, retention, and data quality.\n\n## CLINICAL RESEARCH EXPERIENCE\n\n### Supervisory Research Administrative Coordinator (2022–2025)\n*Clinical Project Manager-equivalent | Regulatory Specialist-equivalent*\n**Pediatric Neuroimaging Core, Marcus Autism Center, School of Medicine, Emory University** — Atlanta, GA\n\n- Led end-to-end operations for multimillion-dollar, device-enabled clinical studies, serving as primary operational and regulatory owner across sites, vendors, data, and study teams\n- Study lifecycle management: Built REDCap databases; prepared regulatory start-up packages; activated new research sites; coordinated vendors for imaging hardware, wearables, and data systems; managed timelines, budgets, and milestones; conducted monthly data audits; coordinated cross-functional teams; proactively mitigated operational and regulatory risks; Led regulatory close-out, data reconciliation, and reporting\n- Regulatory leadership: Led IRB submissions, amendments, and continuing reviews; maintained regulatory binders; interpreted and applied regulatory codes to ensure ICH-GCP and FDA compliance\n- Team leadership: Onboarded study staff; designed and delivered GCP/ICH and protocol training; authored SOPs, study manuals, and scripts to standardize site practices; supported staff performance and retention\n- Impact: Tripled enrollment for hard-to-reach populations and achieved the highest participation of historically underrepresented groups in the program's history\n\n## ADDITIONAL OPERATIONS & PROGRAM LEADERSHIP\n\n### Program Administrator (2024–present)\n**Dr. James A. Ferguson EID RISE Graduate Research Fellowship**\n*Center for Excellence in Public Health Leadership, Kennedy Krieger Institute* — Baltimore, MD\n*Joint faculty appointment: Assistant Scientist, Dept of Molecular Microbiology and Immunology, Bloomberg School of Public Health, Johns Hopkins University*\n\n- Lead strategic planning, recruitment, training, and engagement (100+ annual events) for nationwide public health workforce pipeline supporting 40+ graduate infectious disease research fellows annually\n\n### Operations Lead & Co-founder (2019–2025)\n**Student Network for Amphibian Pathogen Surveillance (SNAPS)** — Remote\n\n- Scaled network from 0 to 1,250+ student participants across 50+ institutions in 33 states\n- Built data collection, communication, and training infrastructure for distributed research execution\n\n### Research Associate | Postdoctoral Scientist (2018–2022)\n**Becker Lab, Department of Biological Sciences, University of Alabama** — Tuscaloosa, AL\n\n- Led international, multi-site emerging infectious disease field research program and molecular analysis pipeline\n- Managed buildout of two molecular labs (budgets, vendor contracts, procurement, training, compliance)\n- Co-managed $1M+ in federal funding; developed budgets, wrote grants (2 NSF awards), and forecasted spend\n- Mentored and facilitated research & publication output of 8 graduate students; authored 17 papers\n\n### Research Ecologist (2005–2014)\n**UGA Marine Institute | Jones Center at Ichauway | La Selva Biological Station | National Park Service** — Various locations\n\n- Implemented multi-site global change research, wildlife infectious disease surveillance, and conservation efforts\n\n## EDUCATION\n- **PhD cum laude**, Biology, James Cook University (2014–2018)\n- **MS**, Biology, University of Maine (2010–2011)\n- **BA**, Environmental Science & Anthropology, Wesleyan University (2002–2006)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770044910918}}
{"type":"message","id":"bb260c30","parentId":"0038403b","timestamp":"2026-02-02T15:08:30.923Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Daily Report Template — Sasha's Job Radar\n\n## Format\n\n```\n☀️ Sasha's Job Radar — [DATE]\n\nHey Sasha! Here's what's out there today 👀\n\n⚙️ Search Settings\n📄 Resume: [RESUME_FILE]\n🔑 Keywords: [KEYWORD_LIST]\n📍 Remote (US) + Hybrid within 30mi of Baltimore\n💰 Minimum: $85k+\n\n📊 Today's Scan\n🔍 Scanned: [N] companies + boards | 🆕 New: [N] postings | ✅ Verified Live: [N] | ❌ Stale/Removed: [N]\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🏢 [COMPANY NAME] — [Location]\n\n[#]️⃣ [Job Title] [🔥 if strong match]\n💰 [Salary or \"Not listed\"] | 📅 [X days ago]\n[2-3 line summary of responsibilities/requirements]\n🏷️ **matching keyword** · non-matching · **matching** · non-matching\n🔗 [Apply link — browser verified]\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🆕 New Company Spotlight\n[COMPANY NAME] — [Location]\n[2-3 line company profile — size, focus area, why relevant]\n\n📉 Removed Since Yesterday\n[Job Title] (Company) — expired/filled\n\n📭 No new postings from: [company list]\n\nAll links browser-verified ✅ | Scanned [DATE/TIME]\n```\n\n## Rules\n- All links MUST be browser-verified before inclusion\n- Dead links are REMOVED, never shared\n- Posted dates on EVERY listing (consistent format: \"📅 X days ago\")\n- Keywords matching Sasha's profile are **bolded** in tags\n- Group by company\n- If no new jobs found, still send report showing companies searched\n- Salary floor $85K+ — no upper limit\n- Flag CRO experience requirements (dealbreaker)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770044910922}}
{"type":"message","id":"fa61a6e3","parentId":"bb260c30","timestamp":"2026-02-02T15:08:36.351Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have the configuration files, resume, and template. Now I need to search for jobs matching Sasha's criteria. Let me conduct multiple searches to find relevant positions.\n\nI'll search for:\n1. Clinical Operations Baltimore\n2. Regulatory Affairs Baltimore remote\n3. Research Manager Baltimore\n4. Clinical Project Manager remote\n5. Hospital Administration Baltimore\n\nAnd also search for specific companies mentioned in the config.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me search for jobs matching Sasha's criteria. I'll run multiple targeted searches."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"web_search:3","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"Clinical Operations Manager Baltimore remote $85,000","count":10}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"web_search:4","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"Regulatory Affairs Specialist Baltimore Maryland remote","count":10}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"web_search:5","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"Research Manager Johns Hopkins University Baltimore","count":10}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"web_search:6","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"Clinical Project Manager Maryland remote pharma biotech","count":10}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"web_search:7","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"\"Clinical Operations\" \"Regulatory Affairs\" site:linkedin.com/jobs","count":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"moonshot","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":9243,"output":233,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9476,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770044910924}}
{"type":"message","id":"93948f46","parentId":"fa61a6e3","timestamp":"2026-02-02T15:08:37.162Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"web_search:3","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"Clinical Operations Manager Baltimore remote $85,000\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 806,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"$72k-$150k Clinical Operations Jobs in Baltimore, MD\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.ziprecruiter.com/Jobs/Clinical-Operations/-in-Baltimore,MD\",\n      \"description\": \"Clinical Services and Operations Manager 📍 Location: Remote 🎓License Requirements: PhD, PsyD, MD, LCSW, LPC, LMFT 💰 <strong>Compensation: $85,000/year</strong> ⏰ Schedule: Full-Time Who We Are: Backpack ...\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.ziprecruiter.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"$40k-$170k Remote Operations Manager Jobs in Baltimore, MD\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.ziprecruiter.com/Jobs/Remote-Operations-Manager/-in-Baltimore,MD\",\n      \"description\": \"Remote Operations Manager Jobs in Baltimore, MD · $30,803 - $38,751 19% of jobs · $40,700 is the 25th percentile. Salaries below this are outliers. $38,752 - $46,700 19% of jobs · $46,701 - $54,649 13% of jobs · $54,650 - $62,598 9% of jobs · The average salary is $63,052 a year · $62,599 - $70,547 10% of jobs · $77,000 is the 75th percentile. Salaries above this are outliers. $70,548 - $78,000 6% of jobs · $78,001 - $85,949 6% of jobs ·\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.ziprecruiter.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"$70k-$170k Remote Clinical Operations Jobs in Maryland\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.ziprecruiter.com/Jobs/Remote-Clinical-Operations/--in-Maryland\",\n      \"description\": \"Browse 191 MARYLAND REMOTE CLINICAL OPERATIONS jobs from companies (hiring now) with openings. Find job opportunities near you and apply!\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.ziprecruiter.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"56 clinical operations manager Jobs in Remote, October 2025 | Glassdoor\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.glassdoor.com/Job/remote-clinical-operations-manager-jobs-SRCH_IL.0,6_IS11047_KO7,34.htm\",\n      \"description\": \"Baltimore, MD · <strong>$85K (Employer provided) Easy Apply</strong> · The Manager will collaborate closely with the Head of Clinical Programs &amp; Operations to oversee program implementation, supervise clinical workflows, monitor…&amp;hellip; Skills: Operations ...\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.glassdoor.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Remote Program Manager Jobs, Employment in Baltimore, MD | Indeed\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.indeed.com/q-remote-program-manager-l-baltimore,-md-jobs.html\",\n      \"description\": \"The base salary for this role is <strong>$90,000 to $115,000</strong>, depending on level of skills and experience.\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.indeed.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Clinical Operations Jobs, Employment in Baltimore, MD | Indeed\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.indeed.com/q-clinical-operations-l-baltimore,-md-jobs.html\",\n      \"description\": \"3,003 Clinical Operations jobs available in Baltimore, MD on Indeed.com. Apply to Product Manager, Program Manager, Navigator and more!\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.indeed.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"20 Best clinical operations manager jobs in baltimore, md (Hiring Now!) | SimplyHired\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.simplyhired.com/search?q=clinical+operations+manager&l=baltimore,+md\",\n      \"description\": \"You will manage all the clinical laboratory operations including technical, scientific, and support functions. Pay: <strong>$110,000.00 - $135,000.00 per year</strong>.\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.simplyhired.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Program Manager - Clinical Support Operations (Remote)\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/program-manager-clinical-support-operations-remote-at-carefirst-bluecross-blueshield-4133988071\",\n      \"description\": \"We cannot provide a description for this page right now\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.linkedin.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Senior Director Clinical Operations - REMOTE job in Baltimore, USA | Proclinical Recruitment\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.proclinical.com/job/senior-director-clinical-operations-remote-in-baltimore-usa-jid-17232\",\n      \"description\": \"Oversees the identification and selection of clinical sites based on feasibility, qualification to ensure that the inclusion of sites is optimal for meeting study enrollment goals, timelines, and quality of data. Develops, reviews and approves department and/or cross-functional standard procedural documents. Initiates and provides operational oversight of workstreams to optimize department and/or cross-functional processes. Manages people and teams, including recruiting and hiring of resources in accordance with the resource plan.\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.proclinical.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"21 Best operations manager jobs in baltimore, md (Hiring Now!) | SimplyHired\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.simplyhired.com/search?q=operations+manager&l=baltimore,+md\",\n      \"description\": \"Estimated: $80,000 - $85,000 a ... searching for a Business Operations Manager who will… · Estimated: $100,000 a year · Quick Apply · 7d · <strong>Daniels Sharpsmart</strong> —Baltimore, MD ·...\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.simplyhired.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"Clinical Operations Manager Baltimore remote $85,000","provider":"brave","count":10,"tookMs":806,"results":[{"title":"$72k-$150k Clinical Operations Jobs in Baltimore, MD","url":"https://www.ziprecruiter.com/Jobs/Clinical-Operations/-in-Baltimore,MD","description":"Clinical Services and Operations Manager 📍 Location: Remote 🎓License Requirements: PhD, PsyD, MD, LCSW, LPC, LMFT 💰 <strong>Compensation: $85,000/year</strong> ⏰ Schedule: Full-Time Who We Are: Backpack ...","siteName