iption":"3,003 Clinical Operations jobs available in Baltimore, MD on Indeed.com. Apply to Product Manager, Program Manager, Navigator and more!","siteName":"www.indeed.com"},{"title":"20 Best clinical operations manager jobs in baltimore, md (Hiring Now!) | SimplyHired","url":"https://www.simplyhired.com/search?q=clinical+operations+manager&l=baltimore,+md","description":"You will manage all the clinical laboratory operations including technical, scientific, and support functions. Pay: <strong>$110,000.00 - $135,000.00 per year</strong>.","siteName":"www.simplyhired.com"},{"title":"Program Manager - Clinical Support Operations (Remote)","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/program-manager-clinical-support-operations-remote-at-carefirst-bluecross-blueshield-4133988071","description":"We cannot provide a description for this page right now","siteName":"www.linkedin.com"},{"title":"Senior Director Clinical Operations - REMOTE job in Baltimore, USA | Proclinical Recruitment","url":"https://www.proclinical.com/job/senior-director-clinical-operations-remote-in-baltimore-usa-jid-17232","description":"Oversees the identification and selection of clinical sites based on feasibility, qualification to ensure that the inclusion of sites is optimal for meeting study enrollment goals, timelines, and quality of data. Develops, reviews and approves department and/or cross-functional standard procedural documents. Initiates and provides operational oversight of workstreams to optimize department and/or cross-functional processes. Manages people and teams, including recruiting and hiring of resources in accordance with the resource plan.","siteName":"www.proclinical.com"},{"title":"21 Best operations manager jobs in baltimore, md (Hiring Now!) | SimplyHired","url":"https://www.simplyhired.com/search?q=operations+manager&l=baltimore,+md","description":"Estimated: $80,000 - $85,000 a ... searching for a Business Operations Manager who will… · Estimated: $100,000 a year · Quick Ap