{"type":"message","id":"b2bd5134","parentId":"86cd35e9","timestamp":"2026-02-02T15:11:51.193Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The RTI International link is DEAD (expired_jd_redirect).\n\nThe Worldwide Clinical Trials link is VALID but it has minimal details in the page - it shows the job exists but doesn't have salary information. Let me search for more specific job details.\n\nNow I have enough valid jobs to compile the report. Let me summarize what I've found:\n\n**VALIDATED WORKING LINKS (with salary ≥$85K or within range):**\n1. ✅ Clinical Research Site Manager (Neurology) at JHU - $55,800-$97,600 - Baltimore, MD - Contract - 1 week ago - https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/clinical-research-site-manager-neurology-at-the-johns-hopkins-university-4365723094\n2. ✅ Clinical Research Manager (Pulmonary) at JHU - $55,800-$97,600 - Baltimore, MD - Full-time - 6 days ago - https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/clinical-research-manager-pulmonary-at-the-johns-hopkins-university-4366224640\n3. ✅ Research Project Manager (Mental Health) at JHU - $55,800-$97,600 - Baltimore, MD - Full-time - 2 weeks ago - https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/research-project-manager-mental-health-at-the-johns-hopkins-university-4330499979\n4. ✅ OPEN RANK: Project Manager or Senior Project Manager at UMB - $105,000-$135,000 - Baltimore, MD - Contract - 6 days ago - https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/open-rank-project-manager-or-senior-project-manager-at-university-of-maryland-baltimore-umb-4366363753\n\n**Note on salary:** The JHU jobs have a range that starts below $85K but goes up to $97,600, which is above the floor. \n\nI'll clarify the salary details for these positions. The upper range exceeds the minimum threshold, making them potentially viable options. I'll compile a comprehensive report highlighting these opportunities, focusing on their key attributes and potential fit.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"The RTI link is dead, but the Worldwide Clinical Trials link is valid (though minimal details). Now I have enough verified jobs to compile the report. Let me generate it and save to the reports directory."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:44","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/sasha-job-search/reports"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"moonshot","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":79529,"output":512,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80041,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770045085476}}
