{"type":"message","id":"2cd13856","parentId":"dd029d5f","timestamp":"2026-02-02T15:12:13.276Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me write the daily report to the reports directory.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"write:45","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"☀️ Sasha's Job Radar — February 2, 2026\n\nHey Sasha! Here's what's out there today 👀\n\n⚙️ Search Settings\n📄 Resume: Sasha_Greenspan_Resume_010326\n🔑 Keywords: Clinical Operations, Regulatory Affairs, Research Manager, Clinical Project Manager, Hospital Administration\n📍 Remote (US) + Hybrid within 30mi of Baltimore\n💰 Minimum: $85k+\n\n📊 Today's Scan\n🔍 Scanned: 25+ companies + boards | 🆕 New: 4 postings | ✅ Verified Live: 4 | ❌ Stale/Removed: 6\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🏢 The Johns Hopkins University — Baltimore, MD\n\n1️⃣ Clinical Research Site Manager (Neurology) 🔥\n💰 $55,800 - $97,600/yr | 📅 1 week ago\nLead research operations for neurology clinical trials. Manage study activities, coordinate with research teams, oversee data collection and regulatory compliance for multisite studies. Contract position with potential for extension.\n🏷️ **clinical research** · **site management** · **neurology** · regulatory compliance · **data coordination**\n🔗 https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/clinical-research-site-manager-neurology-at-the-johns-hopkins-university-4365723094\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n2️⃣ Clinical Research Manager (Pulmonary) 🔥\n💰 $55,800 - $97,600/yr | 📅 6 days ago\nDirect pulmonary research programs, manage clinical trial operations, supervise research staff, and coordinate multi-site respiratory studies. Full-time role with comprehensive JHU benefits package.\n🏷️ **clinical research** · **pulmonary** · **research management** · team leadership · **clinical trials**\n🔗 https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/clinical-research-manager-pulmonary-at-the-johns-hopkins-university-4366224640\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n3️⃣ Research Project Manager (Mental Health) 🔥\n💰 $55,800 - $97,600/yr | 📅 2 weeks ago\nOversee mental health research projects from planning through close-out. Manage cross-functional teams, ensure regulatory compliance, coordinate with stakeholders, and deliver high-quality research outcomes.\n🏷️ **research management** · **mental health** · **project management** · regulatory compliance · **team coordination**\n🔗 https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/research-project-manager-mental-health-at-the-johns-hopkins-university-4330499979\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🏢 University of Maryland, Baltimore (UMB) — Baltimore, MD\n\n4️⃣ OPEN RANK: Project Manager or Senior Project Manager 🔥\n💰 $105,000 - $135,000/yr | 📅 6 days ago\nLead complex research and clinical project initiatives for UMB. Oversee project lifecycles, manage budgets and timelines, coordinate across departments, and ensure successful delivery of research operations. Contract position.\n🏷️ **project management** · **research operations** · **clinical projects** · budget management · **cross-functional leadership**\n🔗 https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/open-rank-project-manager-or-senior-project-manager-at-university-of-maryland-baltimore-umb-4366363753\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🆕 New Company Spotlight\n**The Geneva Foundation** — Maryland (Remote/Hybrid options)\nA nonprofit organization advancing military medicine through innovative research. Partners with military treatment facilities and academic institutions to conduct clinical trials and healthcare research. Strong focus on data management, clinical operations, and regulatory compliance — directly aligned with Sasha's experience.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n📉 Removed Since Yesterday\n- CareFirst - Program Manager, Clinical Support Operations — link expired/filled\n- Takeda - Senior Manager, Clinical Data Management (REMOTE) — link expired\n- Takeda - Associate Director, Clinical Data Management (REMOTE) — link expired\n- Precision Medicine Group - Senior Clinical Trial Manager (REMOTE) — link expired\n- RTI International - Lead Clinical Study Manager (Remote) — link expired\n- JHU - Sr. Clinical Research Program Manager — link expired\n- JHU - Research Program Coordinator — link expired\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n📭 No new postings from: Takeda, Precision Medicine Group, Precision for Medicine, FHI 360, Worldwide Clinical Trials, CareFirst, Emergent BioSolutions, RTI International, Medtronic, AstraZeneca\n\n⚠️ Note on JHU roles: Posted salary ranges start below the $85K floor but extend above it. JHU salaries are often negotiable based on experience, and Sasha's 20+ years of research leadership experience positions her well for the upper end of these ranges.\n\nAll links browser-verified ✅ | Scanned 2026-02-02 15:11 UTC\n","path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/sasha-job-search/reports/daily-report-2026-02-02.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"moonshot","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":80060,"output":1123,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81183,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770045111214}}
